[{"title":"寓南安寺逢初度日大开上人为拈香庆赞口占志谢","author":"罗万杰","text":"颠毛种种四旬馀，阅世终悲岁月虚。\n镜里空花呈起灭，眼前流水悟乘除。\n谩誇丁令千年鹤，且趁杨岐三脚驴。\n博得蒲团香半炷，多君滴水沁芙蕖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄寿黄字河道长","author":"罗万杰","text":"成佛生天谁后先，幻人同种幻因缘。\n羡君九日当初度，迟我二旬作少年。\n幸有黄花供晚醉，不妨白发傲时贤。\n问奇竞索题糕字，笑挈青筇淩紫烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊申除夕示诸道友","author":"罗万杰","text":"空惊华发逐年陈，又遇寒岩一度春。\n屋角梅花香入座，尊前柏叶味宜人。\n家风好共安冷澹，岁月何须判旧新。\n榾柮满炉消永夜，梦魂不到鳄江滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏溪云庐为姚孝廉兄弟作","author":"罗万杰","text":"白云堆里数峰阴，翠竹苍松绕涧浔。\n卜筑刚栽棣萼树，幽栖时费蓼莪吟。\n溪山结侣情偏挚，屺岵兴思感独深。\n誓墓终偕兄弟隐，采芝不负九原心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻黄迂父辞荣归养寄赠一律","author":"罗万杰","text":"闻道飘然赋遂初，归来子舍乐何如。\n日穿南牖问安后，春护北堂视膳馀。\n自有菜衣供色笑，不将菽水换簪裾。\n相逢莫讶休官早，正值慈闱健起居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴间十匊芳斋即席赋赠","author":"罗万杰","text":"幽居端不负斯堂，看剑衔杯引兴长。\n旧业传家帷尚灺，华文照世箧先光。\n图书以外他无物，庭户之间别有香。\n便拟卜邻傍此地，偏因丘壑性难忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己酉除夕","author":"罗万杰","text":"老来渐觉万缘轻，纸帐布衾梦易成。\n雨浥炉烟蒸永夜，风摇烛影袅深更。\n流光暗逐閒中过，华发俱从愁里生。\n拟待明朝天气煖，探梅山壑杖藜行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚戌元日","author":"罗万杰","text":"山林别是一家春，野老忘机岁月频。\n细雨轻风新节物，宽衣博带旧时人。\n桃花迎露开偏早，竹叶轻霜酿独醇。\n笑挈胡床傍树影，卧看岩色翠嶙峋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春朝即事","author":"罗万杰","text":"翠筠深处绿阴寒，鸟语喧喧近药栏。\n落尽梅花春气早，焚馀芋火晓烟残。\n愤成楚曲沉湘怨，羞把楞严面壁看。\n老病经年事事懒，呼童唯讯竹平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕即事","author":"罗万杰","text":"冷落园扉晚不关，茗烟迥出竹林间。\n煨残黄独僧初定，踏遍青苔客未还。\n灯影终嫌霜月澹，花枝应怯冷风顽。\n每嫌村鼓连宵闹，不许山斋梦独閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日感作","author":"罗万杰","text":"梅花落尽满荒园，晓看檐前积雨痕。\n暖气不生枯木叶，春风空到竹篱门。\n息心终自依禅侣，避地还须洽隐沦。\n痛哭太平耕种日，夜来鸡犬静无喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题自画扇水墨桂花","author":"罗万杰","text":"傲骨秋来瘦，幽香月里生。\n嫣然重一笑，不肯作倾城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自画墨菊赠公眉","author":"罗万杰","text":"欹斜高士影，惟悴驿人魄。\n不受众欣怜，远神先自得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古离别三首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"送别垂杨下，泪沾树上花。\n晓风吹不尽，飘泊到天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古离别三首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"天涯忽已远，日暮心如焚。\n盼望空阶下，寒山隔彩云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古离别三首 其三","author":"罗万杰","text":"綵云撩乱飞，去作相思梦。\n觉来萦妾肠，閒把玉箫弄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别","author":"罗万杰","text":"大秦明月珠，绝宝世间无。\n开匣持相赠，照君锦氍毹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡淮","author":"罗万杰","text":"浮云岭外色，落日旅中心。\n辛苦问淮水，客愁孰浅深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五仄体夏日偶成","author":"罗万杰","text":"暑气入嫩柳，落日映翠竹。\n独卧北牖下，待得荔子熟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜不寐步月偶成回文一首","author":"罗万杰","text":"帘捲风花落，径遮露草深。\n严更催短梦，皎月对閒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西来意","author":"罗万杰","text":"云来竹影暗，雨过松声凉。\n若问西来意，溪深杓柄长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题二首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"生计岩前树，素交云外山。\n愁来天地老，醉去古今閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题二首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"心对寒灰死，形同槁叶凋。\n鸡谈共楖栗，蝶梦付团蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"折肱已更三，立壁惟馀四。\n一副光皮囊，逢场且作戏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"蚤年漫学数，不识五和十。\n挟策问君平，噬脐悔莫及。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其三","author":"罗万杰","text":"冷落茅檐下，残釭剔半明。\n梅花瘦比我，窗外影交横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其四","author":"罗万杰","text":"生死同醒睡，亦如夕复朝。\n须知根本地，原不属增消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其五","author":"罗万杰","text":"短发飒风吹，盛年逝水过。\n古今梦几回，静眼忽窥破。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其六","author":"罗万杰","text":"蛰鳞尽屈伏，倦翮自低飞。\n岚气晚来重，呼童掩竹扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其七","author":"罗万杰","text":"候火夜铛煖，松风数沸腾。\n茶烟轻袅袅，迥出白云层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其八","author":"罗万杰","text":"徘徊苔径深，徙倚林光暮。\n爆竹响空山，栖禽惊不度。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其九","author":"罗万杰","text":"卧云枕涧流，跂石荫疏景。\n清磬数声中，悠然发深省。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬辰除夜 其十","author":"罗万杰","text":"夜静灯花落，天寒香篆斜。\n斋厨缺芝术，釜甑任尘沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词三首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"木兰花映木兰舟，花自妖娇水自流。\n贪看堤间杨柳色，不知舟落小滩头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词三首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"小姬酿酒唤人尝，玉盌擎来扑鼻香。\n门前五尺垂丝柳，系尽江南年少肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词三首 其三","author":"罗万杰","text":"轻纨五丈细如絺，剪就单衫着地垂。\n江滨日暖浑无事，火伴相邀赌荔枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽燕老将歌","author":"罗万杰","text":"曾共嫖姚擒可汗，至今刀暗血犹丹。\n壮心不逐年华尽，夜夜旄头拂剑看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行二首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"陌上如烟侠少游，金镳骏马白狐裘。\n鸣鞭转入柳堤去，无数杨花扑紫骝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行二首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"春风同醉酒家胡，据坐狂歌意气粗。\n抛却酒钱不用数，临行犹自盼当垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴","author":"罗万杰","text":"一瓢浊酒竹床边，潦倒狂夫长自怜。\n醉卧不知秋色尽，西风憔悴菊花天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第出都呈南归诸友五首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"燕山落日盼归程，台上千金吊郭卿。\n自是君王怜骏骨，驽骀何敢滥时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第出都呈南归诸友五首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"敝却貂裘耐却尘，春风回首易沾巾。\n囊中剩有酒钱在，羞说当年问舌人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第出都呈南归诸友五首 其三","author":"罗万杰","text":"长铗驱驰日色沉，一樽对影倍萧森。\n凭将燕市和歌泪，洒到陵阳石里心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第出都呈南归诸友五首 其四","author":"罗万杰","text":"征鞍无处不飞沙，渐觉林光散晚霞。\n去去燕云携满袖，行行岭月落谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第出都呈南归诸友五首 其五","author":"罗万杰","text":"夹道轻烟暖拍堤，春山障眼客魂迷。\n野花不及垂杨色，并与茸茸缀马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨篇四首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"杨花飞尽散孤村，远客归思劳梦魂。\n欹枕自怜春色晚，满江风雨一灯昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨篇四首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"风吹暮雨透轻寒，落日扁舟系未安。\n遥想故园春草色，祇今犹作梦中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨篇四首 其三","author":"罗万杰","text":"风自萧颾雨自愁，望来云气每疑秋。\n登临畏向高原去，恐有鹡鸰在上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨篇四首 其四","author":"罗万杰","text":"江风阵阵雨霏霏，满目浮云白日微。\n尚忆联床旧有约，不知兹夕愿先违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"罗万杰","text":"朱颜华发是耶非，芒履无心野鹿肥。\n我亦从来耽酒兴，借君筇杖醉扶归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日美人蕉与池畔梅花对植偶作二首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"怯寒贪睡意迟迟，掩映疏棂影若私。\n肯与老梅为近侍，呼他名字绿衣儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日美人蕉与池畔梅花对植偶作二首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"绿鬟朱靥自为春，妆罢从教晓露嗔。\n一夕寒飙连夕雨，可怜憔悴捧心人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新嘉驿署旧有会稽女子留题三绝悽婉动人予以戊寅暮春过宿其处则壁间之句已磨灭不可复识矣感慨之馀仍和韵吊之 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"可是芳心化作尘，那能频忆梦中身。\n生憎绣幕花间蝶，不逐东风恋暮春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新嘉驿署旧有会稽女子留题三绝悽婉动人予以戊寅暮春过宿其处则壁间之句已磨灭不可复识矣感慨之馀仍和韵吊之 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"不须绝调与同游，薄命终怜恨已悠。\n可惜阶前今夜月，无人空自上帘钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新嘉驿署旧有会稽女子留题三绝悽婉动人予以戊寅暮春过宿其处则壁间之句已磨灭不可复识矣感慨之馀仍和韵吊之 其三","author":"罗万杰","text":"墨迹歌残知为谁，未成短韵先成悲。\n数声啼鴂怨芳草，不是闺人亦泪垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉使荆回宿万安僧舍次壁间韵","author":"罗万杰","text":"征衣犹带洞庭沙，阅尽残冬未见家。\n野寺寒灯独卧处，关心一夜到梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"齐昌邸中送朗润上人还山","author":"罗万杰","text":"离亭草色正芳菲，落日斜阳把客衣。\n回首故山杳霭外，断云应傍锡声飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"嵯峨石笋倚云栽，樵径无人任野苔。\n最爱东峰明月色，夜深斜入板扉来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"冷落柴扉晚不扃，爨烟遥映夕岚青。\n芒鞋转入茅冈去，折得梅花插胆瓶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其三","author":"罗万杰","text":"杖藜望入晚烟空，碧巘苍岩指顾中。\n短后应随拾栗老，长歌不数采芝翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其四","author":"罗万杰","text":"手植梅花近百株，青山从此变芬敷。\n兔葵燕麦浑无赖，摇荡春风总让渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其五","author":"罗万杰","text":"欲沽村酿饷山樵，短树槎枒暂挂瓢。\n习懒愈成枯寂僻，经旬不赴野人招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其六","author":"罗万杰","text":"漫将生计托长镵，总被时人笑老憨。\n造物亦怜客衲薄，严霜飞不到茅庵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其七","author":"罗万杰","text":"荒冈草色入秋残，带露松声彻夜寒。\n独坐拥衾无一事，挑灯简取佛经看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居杂诗八首 其八","author":"罗万杰","text":"半钩斜月挂岩屏，香篆初残梦已醒。\n横按一枝无孔笛，峰前吹与石人听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅五子山图寄赠无用上人","author":"罗万杰","text":"邈得层峰结胜缘，青山似欲嬲枯禅。\n他时了却芒鞋债，襆被来寻绝顶眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠黄檗山僧","author":"罗万杰","text":"小缚团蕉竹涧边，此心何事不悠然。\n贪他清味耐他苦，黄檗山中住十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38094,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢客","author":"罗万杰","text":"白云堆里数峰深，多谢时人拨草寻。\n便欲出头来合伴，恐违当日住山心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38095,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热病中口占","author":"罗万杰","text":"溽暑何曾宽病翁，汗衫脱却引清风。\n山间自有纳凉处，烧药炉头火正红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38096,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃子坪","author":"罗万杰","text":"无数桃花傍岭生，茅檐低与白云平。\n樵歌转入深林里，忽乱阶前流水声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38097,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崎溜下","author":"罗万杰","text":"寻幽不惮径途艰，行到水穷云起山。\n一带梨花闻犬吠，人家近在翠微间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38098,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高岃","author":"罗万杰","text":"绝顶平天一线通，野僧耕凿白云中。\n解衣稍憩松林晚，万叠乱山夕照红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38099,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和平波道人原韵","author":"罗万杰","text":"碧水青山指点中，秋光澹处暮云浓。\n平担楖栗千峰去，极目沧波感慨同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38100,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"罗万杰","text":"梧叶无风亦落，菊花带雨犹开。\n那堪此日憔悴，更被笛声吹来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38101,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瞻六堂即事十首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"一间陋室容膝，几种幽花惬衷。\n此是痴人雅福，问谁清梦能同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38102,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瞻六堂即事十首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"往迹悠悠几许，浮生攘攘何心。\n无边树色远近，不尽溪流浅深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":38103,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]